WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:01.600
You're thoughtful, my lady

00:01.760 --> 00:03.400
You've come at just the right time

00:03.480 --> 00:05.080
My shoulder still hurts

00:09.880 --> 00:11.280
Come

00:20.240 --> 00:21.840
Is Your Majesty better?

00:23.000 --> 00:24.400
I am better

00:25.760 --> 00:26.880
Your Majesty

00:26.960 --> 00:28.560
I came this time

00:28.640 --> 00:30.280
First to visit Your Majesty

00:30.360 --> 00:31.200
Second

00:31.280 --> 00:32.947
Also commissioned by Chancellor Xie

00:33.360 --> 00:34.520
Says there are state matters

00:34.600 --> 00:36.267
To discuss with Your Majesty

00:37.720 --> 00:39.120
I know

00:39.480 --> 00:41.160
Have him wait for me at the Imperial Administration Palace

00:41.240 --> 00:42.440
Yes

